  icon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: c55cc35e40a404507a40a804fa1d4852, type: 3}
  iconMaxWidth: 128
  projectName: U6 Game Architecture Project
  author: Sid Greenwood
  modificationDate: 2026-05-17
  sections:
  - heading: '* Event System Note'
    text: 'Due to seperation of certain main manager canvases and player canvases,
      it is not easy to utilize a multiplayer event system on each Player Input Object.
      A standalone Event System is used in scene.


      What this entials is that
      automatic navigation, or special ui features like scroll bars for ui are not
      suitable to use with more than 1 player. (Think player 1''s scroll being read
      by both players due to the nature of the standalone Event System.)'
  - heading: '* Fill Split Screen Note'
    text: For split screen players with the fill setting on, the player canvas prefab
      will need to be resized and scaled to account for the non-default resolution
      that derives from the fill if the screen portion will not be even. (2-3 players).
  - heading: '* Mobile Note'
    text: "For mobile, if cursor not desired, turn off the image in the cursor prefab.
      \n\nAdditionally, make sure to turn on the (normally optional) pause button
      in the relevant play ui page prefab, since there is no button to pause with
      on mobile."
  showReadMeEditor: 1
